    {
      "id": "FR01",
      "finding": "Minifiable means minifiedDef exists. FurnitureBase supplies MinifiedThing; furniture quality/bed components are inherited separately. MakeMinified despawns the original and places that same Thing inside a new one-stack wrapper; no new furniture or quality roll is created.",
