      "id": "FR02",
      "finding": "Wrapper and inner object have separate IDs and hit points. MinifiedThing deep-saves its one-stack innerContainer; inspect text delegates to the inner furniture but its health bar belongs to the wrapper. Normal reinstall clears InnerThing before destroying the wrapper and returns the existing inner entity.",
