      "id": "FR03",
      "finding": "Explicit Uninstall uses JobDriver_RemoveBuilding: default building.uninstallWork200, workLeft decreases ConstructionSpeed*1.7*delta, serialized progress belongs to that job. The driver does not award Construction XP. FinishedRemoving uninstalls and increments ThingsUninstalled. ActiveSkill is not XP gain.",
