      "id": "FR04",
      "finding": "InstallJob creates HaulToContainer with source A, install blueprint B and count1. It checks source reachability, forbidden/reservation and another pawn carrying it; the driver reserves both. It walks to source, optionally uninstalls a still-installed source, carries it to B, steps out of footprint, replaces blueprint with the original furniture and deposits.",
