      "finding": "Blueprint_Install WorkTotal150 is inspect-display work. HaulToContainer Duration returns0 for a non-Building destination, including a blueprint; the displayed150 must not be converted into a150-tick installation timer. Install blueprint material cost is empty and no Frame/quality reroll is used. Optional uninstall uses the200-work path; unlike explicit Uninstall it does not increment ThingsUninstalled there.",
