    {
      "id": "FR06",
      "finding": "Ordinary colonist bed ownership is temporarily unclaimed on despawn and cached in uninstalledAssignedPawns. Spawn tries to restore only valid pawns with no newly owned bed and compatible assignment status, then clears the cache. Both current and temporary owner lists serialize; restoration is conditional, not an unconditional overwrite.",
