    {
      "id": "FR07",
      "finding": "Building_Bed DeSpawn except WillReplace resets ForOwnerType to Colonist, Medical=false and alreadySetDefaultMed=false. Setters can remove owners before generic uninstalled-owner caching. Spawn can reapply default medical or prison-room rules. Original medical/prisoner flags are not generally retained by relocation.",
