    {
      "id": "FR08",
      "finding": "CompGatherSpot serializes active. Despawn unregisters from the gather-spot lister without clearing active; player-owned spawn preserves it and registers. This component differs from the bed purpose reset; preserving entity identity does not imply every operational flag has the same lifecycle.",
