    {
      "id": "FR09",
      "finding": "Starting the install designator cancels previous install blueprints for the source, matched through inner identity across maps. Placement uses normal CanPlaceBlueprintAt with source/inner exceptions; identical source location and rotation are rejected. Canceling a blueprint does not destroy the original furniture.",
