      "id": "FR10",
      "finding": "Before replacing an install blueprint, FirstBlockingThing is checked; failure ends the job Incompletable before unpacking. WorkGiver can instead request plant cutting/hauling/removal for some blockers. Cancelled or missing destination fails HaulToContainer. Exact generic interrupted-carry drop location is not established by these selected sources.",
