      "id": "FR11",
      "finding": "Destroying a wrapper while its inner still exists cancels install blueprints and destroys the contained thing, with leavings depending on destroy mode. Successful reinstall first detaches inner, so wrapper destruction does not destroy that furniture. Trading also cancels install plans. Installed Building.Destroy cancels related plans.",
